  "Solution": "The sum is 36, and 1 addend is 15, so the other addend is 21.\n\nAlternative method 1: Subtract the ten, then the ones\n\nSince \\(15=10+5\\), subtract its ten first and then its five ones:\n\\[\n36-15=36-10-5=26-5=21.\n\\]\nThe result is \\(21\\).",
